WEBVTT

NOTE
English captions for a 57-second excerpt of Elephants Dream (2006), Orange Open Movie Project, Blender Foundation, CC BY 2.5.
Subtitles from Wikimedia Commons (TimedText), CC BY-SA 4.0; times shifted to start at the excerpt.

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.130
At the left we can see…

2
00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:07.500
At the right we can see the—

3
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:08.980
…the head-snarlers.

4
00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.550
Everything is safe… Perfectly safe.

5
00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:12.770
Emo?

6
00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:14.220
Emo?

7
00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:17.104
Watch out!

8
00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:35.260
Are you hurt?

9
00:00:38.990 --> 00:00:41.200
I don’t think so. You?

10
00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:44.090
I’m OK.

11
00:00:44.090 --> 00:00:48.110
Get up, Emo! It’s not safe here.

12
00:00:49.030 --> 00:00:50.229
Let’s go.

13
00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:52.190
What’s next?

14
00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:53.960
You’ll see!

15
00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:55.840
You’ll see!
